Subject: Re: [stan-users] Toonces The Driving Model: Quasi-discrete model does converge, just not very well!
Message-ID: <kPRa_66UekU.eQj160pdEQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <kPRa_66UekU.zNmI9OSZEAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <kPRa_66UekU.dsjkpz3_DwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <kPRa_66UekU.zNmI9OSZEAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/kPRa_66UekU/m/eQj160pdEQAJ>
