Also, after checking the paper by Scollnik http://www.actuaries.org/LIBRARY/ASTIN/vol28no1/135.pdf , seems like the way to go would be to use a truncated generalized poisson distribution, as with the generalized poisson, probabilities might end up not being normalized (add up to unity) and it is also unrealistic to expect very high count values for my particular data at hand.
Now I need to see how to actually make it work!

