You won't get the posterior mode through sampling, only the
posterior mean.  Bt rather than using point estimates for
downstream inference, Stan lets you use full Bayesian inference.
The chapter in the manual on Bayesian stats explains all this.

Any divergent transitions after warmup are sign for concern.
Have you tried plotting where the divergences happen?  And
what error messages are you getting from them?

- Bob

