Subject: Undefined variables in generated quantities, categorical logit discrete choice model
Message-ID: <cf_w2o5QdaI.mFDI53MfAAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/cf_w2o5QdaI/m/mFDI53MfAAAJ>
