> > > > > I specify STAR(1) model:
> > > > > y(t) = (f01 + f02*y(t-1))*(1 - G(st;g,c)) + (f11 + f12*y(t-1))*G(st;g,c) + sigma * epsilon(t), epsilon(t)~i.i.d.(0,1)
> > > > > and
> > > > > G(st;g,c) = (1 + exp(-g*(st-c)))^(-1), g>0
> > > > > where st = t/T and t=1,2,...,T.
