> > > > > }
> > > > > model {
> > > > >  for (n in 2:T){
> > > > >         r[n] ~normal((0.1 + 0.3*r[n-1])*(1 - G[n]) + (0.5 + 0.8*r[n-1])*(G[n]) , sigma);
