There is a file named simply "makefile" right at the top level of
the CmdStan distribution.  There's also a directory called "make".
If you don't have those, you don't have the right distribution.

You want the downloads from here:

  https://github.com/stan-dev/cmdstan/releases

such as:

  https://github.com/stan-dev/cmdstan/releases/download/v2.14.0/cmdstan-2.14.0.zip

I just verified those files are present and accounted for.

- Bob

